WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.134 --> 00:00:16.438
Roxy watched the strange girl skip down West Street.

2
00:00:16.439 --> 00:00:20.216
"La, la, la, la, la!" the girl sang.

3
00:00:20.217 --> 00:00:24.758
"That girl is shrinking things all over Metro City," thought Roxy.

4
00:00:24.759 --> 00:00:30.265
"I have to stop her before the entire city is gone!"

5
00:00:30.266 --> 00:00:36.243
As Roxy started to fly, she heard a sound.

6
00:00:36.244 --> 00:00:40.538
Meow! A cat was looking at something on the sidewalk.

7
00:00:40.539 --> 00:00:44.516
Roxy looked down.

8
00:00:44.517 --> 00:00:47.786
"Tiny people!" Roxy cried.

9
00:00:47.787 --> 00:00:51.577
Small, scared people were running away from the cat.

10
00:00:51.578 --> 00:00:54.980
"Please help!" someone cried.

11
00:00:54.981 --> 00:00:59.331
"That cat is going to eat us!" shouted another person.

12
00:00:59.332 --> 00:01:03.504
Meow! The cat leaped through the air.

13
00:01:03.505 --> 00:01:06.517
Roxy caught the cat before it landed.

14
00:01:06.518 --> 00:01:15.081
"Bad kitty!" she said. "You shouldn't eat people!"

15
00:01:15.082 --> 00:01:21.969
Roxy led the tiny people into a pizza shop.

16
00:01:21.970 --> 00:01:24.671
"Stay here," she said.

17
00:01:24.672 --> 00:01:29.015
"I'm going to stop this shrinking right now!"

18
00:01:29.016 --> 00:01:31.627
Roxy ran back outside.

19
00:01:31.628 --> 00:01:36.989
"Rocket Girl!" screamed a tiny voice. "Help me!"

20
00:01:36.990 --> 00:01:40.151
"Who needs help now?" Roxy wondered.

21
00:01:40.152 --> 00:01:43.662
She looked up and saw a hawk flying away.

22
00:01:43.663 --> 00:01:48.177
Roxy used her super vision.

23
00:01:48.178 --> 00:01:50.313
"Uh-oh!" Roxy cried.

24
00:01:50.314 --> 00:01:54.183
"That hawk is flying away with a tiny man!"

25
00:01:54.184 --> 00:01:59.259
Roxy shot through the air. Zoom!

26
00:01:59.260 --> 00:02:01.105
"Hand over that little man!"

27
00:02:01.106 --> 00:02:03.013
Roxy yelled at the hawk.

28
00:02:03.014 --> 00:02:05.735
The hawk dropped the man and flew away.

29
00:02:05.736 --> 00:02:10.233
"Oh no!" the man shouted. "I'm falling!"

30
00:02:10.234 --> 00:02:16.257
Zoom! Roxy flew fast and caught the man.

31
00:02:16.258 --> 00:02:19.887
"Whew!" said Roxy as she landed.

32
00:02:19.888 --> 00:02:21.557
Crunch!

33
00:02:21.558 --> 00:02:24.702
"What was that?" Roxy wondered.

34
00:02:24.703 --> 00:02:27.162
"Hey!" A tiny voice yelled.

35
00:02:27.163 --> 00:02:29.999
"I just bought that car!"

36
00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:32.757
Roxy looked down.

37
00:02:32.758 --> 00:02:37.682
A small smashed car fell from the bottom of her boot.

38
00:02:37.683 --> 00:02:42.473
"Sorry about that!" Roxy said.

39
00:02:42.474 --> 00:02:45.840
Again Roxy leaped into the air and flew off.

40
00:02:45.841 --> 00:02:50.147
"Now I need to find that strange girl," said Roxy.

41
00:02:50.148 --> 00:02:55.633
Roxy flew above Metro City.

42
00:02:55.634 --> 00:03:03.316
She looked everywhere, but she didn't see the girl.

43
00:03:03.317 --> 00:03:07.514
"Hmph!" Roxy sat on the roof of a building to think.

44
00:03:07.515 --> 00:03:13.095
Suddenly . . . Whirr! The building under her started shrinking!

45
00:03:13.096 --> 00:03:15.899
And the girl was down on the street!

46
00:03:15.900 --> 00:03:21.456
Roxy leaped off the building.

47
00:03:21.457 --> 00:03:24.519
"What a cute little building!"

48
00:03:24.520 --> 00:03:29.149
The girl giggled and put the building into one of her pockets.

49
00:03:29.150 --> 00:03:34.287
"La, la, la, la, la!" The girl sang as she skipped down the street.

50
00:03:34.288 --> 00:03:40.098
"Hey!" yelled Roxy. "Stop right there!"

51
00:03:40.099 --> 00:03:44.267
The strange girl looked up and saw Roxy zooming down at her.

52
00:03:44.268 --> 00:03:46.533
The girl looked scared.

53
00:03:46.534 --> 00:03:50.578
"Oh!" the girl cried. "Oh no!"

54
00:03:50.579 --> 00:03:55.214
The little girl pointed the device at Roxy. Whirr!

55
00:03:55.215 --> 00:04:04.263
"Ahh!" Roxy screamed. "I'm shrinking!"
